# Liquid Coding Patterns

## Section structure

Every section follows this template:

```liquid
{% comment %} Brief description of what this section does {% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign var_name = section.settings.setting_id | default: fallback
-%}

<section
  class="section-name"
  data-section-type="matching-ts-type"
  data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
  style="--custom-prop: {{ section.settings.value }}"
>
  {%- comment -%} Markup here {%- endcomment -%}
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:translation.key",
  "settings": [ ... ]
}
{% endschema %}
```

## Key patterns

- Use `{%- liquid ... -%}` tag for multi-line variable assignments (whitespace-trimmed)
- Use `{%- if -%}` / `{%- endif -%}` (hyphenated) to control whitespace
- CSS variables on the section root element for dynamic settings
- `data-section-type` must exactly match the `SECTION_TYPE` constant in the paired TypeScript file
- `data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"` required for editor events
- Use `data-*` attributes for JS hooks, never classes

## Image rendering

```liquid
{{ image | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag:
    loading: 'lazy',
    alt: image.alt,
    class: 'class-name',
    widths: '400,600,800,1200,1600',
    sizes: '(min-width: 62em) 25vw, 50vw'
}}
```

- First image above fold: `loading: 'eager'`; everything else: `loading: 'lazy'`
- Always provide `widths` and `sizes` for responsive images

## Schema conventions

- Use translation keys for `name` and `label` where available: `"t:general.xxx"`
- Settings types: `range`, `checkbox`, `select`, `text`, `richtext`, `image_picker`, `color`, `color_scheme`
- Group related settings with `"type": "header"`

## Snippet naming

- PDP snippets: `pdp-gallery`, `pdp-variant-picker`, `pdp-buy-row`, etc.
- Header snippets: `header-logo`, `header-site-nav`, `header-icons`
- Rendered with: `{% render 'snippet-name', param: value %}`
- Snippets are isolated scope — pass all needed variables explicitly

## Section groups

- Header: `{% sections 'header-group' %}` in layout
- Footer: `{% sections 'footer-group' %}` in layout
- Cart drawer: `{% section 'cart-drawer' %}` (always rendered in layout)

## Forms

- AJAX cart forms use `data-ajax-add-to-cart` attribute
- Product forms: `{% form 'product', product %}`

## Theme Check

- Config: `.theme-check.yml` extends `theme-check:recommended`
- Run: `npm run check`
- Known exceptions documented in `.theme-check.yml` (UnclosedHTMLElement for PDP, RemoteAsset for Google Fonts)
